  message: "Follow-up (not blocking): a producer-side op-writer audit could confirm no code path emits an explicit-null set/add/remove dict (the consumer guard in PR #4188 tolerates any serialization, so this is defense-in-depth, not a correctness gap). Filed under Wave-0 item 4 alongside B1-B6 defect intake."  # a47f
